{"id":"n41572-1-6","stage":4,"title":"눈발 · 雪","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41572-1-6-1","ko":"점점 눈발이 굵어지고 있어요.","zh":"雪越下越大了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"눈발이","meaning":"雪，雪片","explanation":"눈발：雪，雪片；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈발","audio":"/audio/6bf836b0b70e94f7de4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41572","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈발이","audio":"/audio/8e531577790f9305b676.mp3"}},{"text":"굵어지고","meaning":"大，粗大，大颗；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"굵다：大，粗大，大颗；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"굵다","audio":"/audio/f0e74315d7de77f237b8.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89458","senseId":"3","lemma":"굵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굵어지고","audio":"/audio/c42623634c4019532613.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"6bf836b0b70e94f7","term":"눈발","zh":"雪，雪片","audio":"/audio/6bf836b0b70e94f7de4d.mp3","entryId":"41572","definition":"下得很大的雪。",